      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I highly recommend having world info (or if in a private world) being shown if you click on someone in the friend's wing. As it is right now, you really have no idea where you'll end up when joining someone this way unless you sort by location or click one more time to view their profile. Having to perform another click to view more info is the opposite of what the QM's purpose is though.",
